{{smaller|'''Trapezoidal wall''', a retaining wall, upright where it comes against the bank, but with a sloping face.—'''Vitrified wall.''' See ''vitrified''.—'''Wall-barley.''' Same as ''squirreltail''.—'''Wall-teeth.''' Same as ''molar teeth'' (which see, under ''tooth''). (See also ''party-wall, training-wall''.)}}

